{"type":"message","id":"ff265edc","parentId":"71df7e3a","timestamp":"2026-03-29T10:42:29.748Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b53a46fe060a0eea0663a2d33cf1\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_cb5c7afa7e77cafdeaeae1620a2a383a\",\n  \"conversation_label\": \"oc_badefa41a5267f2823cd495b63dd6ce5\",\n  \"sender\": \"ou_cb5c7afa7e77cafdeaeae1620a2a383a\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Sun 2026-03-29 10:42 UTC\",\n  \"group_subject\": \"oc_badefa41a5267f2823cd495b63dd6ce5\",\n  \"is_group_chat\": true,\n  \"was_mentioned\": true\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"ou_cb5c7afa7e77cafdeaeae1620a2a383a\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_cb5c7afa7e77cafdeaeae1620a2a383a\",\n  \"name\": \"ou_cb5c7afa7e77cafdeaeae1620a2a383a\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b53a46fe060a0eea0663a2d33cf1]\nou_cb5c7afa7e77cafdeaeae1620a2a383a: 你读完了么\n\n[System: The content may include mention tags in the form <at user_id=\"...\">name</at>. Treat these as real mentions of Feishu entities (users or bots).]\n[System: If user_id is \"ou_07c0309729130105098ae6fa4d566956\", that mention refers to you.]"}],"timestamp":1774780949718}}
