{"type":"message","id":"8d9f4aa4","parentId":"4f07ef1b","timestamp":"2026-03-29T10:46:12.950Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants me to continue. I was in the middle of reading the ECHO document and had saved a summary. The subagent was also running to design the ECHO × OpenClaw integration project. Let me check on the subagent status and continue with the work.\n\nActually, looking at the context, I had:\n1. Read the ECHO document\n2. Saved a summary to ECHO协议接口总结.md\n3. Spawned a subagent to design the ECHO × OpenClaw integration\n\nThe subagent completed (or there's a completion event coming). Let me fetch the subagent's result and continue with providing the project design to the user.\n\nWait, looking at the conversation flow - I already replied with the summary. The subagent was designing the project. Let me check if the subagent completed and get its output.\n\nActually, I should check if there's a subagent completion. Let me fetch the history or check on the subagent.\n\nLooking at the sessions, I spawned a subagent with runId \"a519265d-4683-4979-b57e-899cac358e28\". I should check if it completed.\n\nActually, the user said \"Continue where you left off. The previous model attempt failed or timed out.\" This suggests my previous attempt may have been interrupted. The subagent was running to design the ECHO × OpenClaw project.\n\nLet me check the subagent status and continue.","thinkingSignature":"18dc60cc7eda943d66c9f04d019cd9743bae89d3d8a55584cb3108d2e27b9f0e"},{"type":"text","text":"让我继续之前的工作，检查子代理的设计方案结果：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_47klgq1lf6qo_1","name":"sessions_history","arguments":{"sessionKey":"agent:lucus:subagent:4ad0a177-b8dd-42e6-9c29-49cac741b022","limit":5,"includeTools":false}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"minimax-m2.5:free","usage":{"input":10,"output":382,"cacheRead":869,"cacheWrite":14830,"totalTokens":16091,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cache