{"type":"message","id":"c66b6e5b","parentId":"5bda0e91","timestamp":"2026-03-29T10:46:20.243Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_4990hnus1tel_1","toolName":"sessions_history","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"sessionKey\": \"agent:lucus:subagent:4ad0a177-b8dd-42e6-9c29-49cac741b022\",\n  \"messages\": [\n    {\n      \"role\": \"user\",\n      \"content\": [\n        {\n          \"type\": \"text\",\n          \"text\": \"Continue where you left off. The previous model attempt failed or timed out.\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"timestamp\": 1774780979479,\n      \"__openclaw\": {\n        \"id\": \"17876d90\",\n        \"seq\": 1\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"role\": \"assistant\",\n      \"content\": [\n        {\n          \"type\": \"thinking\",\n          \"thinking\": \"The user wants me to continue with the task I was assigned. Let me review the subagent context:\\n\\nI was tasked with designing a complete project that integrates the ECHO protocol (an asset licensing/permission protocol on EVM) with OpenClaw AI Agent ecosystem.\\n\\nLet me continue and produce the comprehensive project design document.\\n\\n## ECHO Protocol Summary:\\n- Roles: Issuer (creates/manages assets), Holder (holds assets), User (temporary users)\\n- Operations: issue, transfer, view_meta, view_secret, use_license, pause/resume/expire_license, grant_usage\\n- Asset types: License (consumable), Subscription (time-limited), AccessToken (temporary)\\n\\n## Task Requirements:\\n1. Overall architecture design\\n2. Core functional modules\\n3. React frontend project design\\n4. Technology selection & implementation roadmap\\n\\nLet me produce a comprehensive design document.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"type\": \"text\",\n          \"text\": \"<final>\\n\\n# ECHO Protocol × OpenClaw AI Agent 整合项目设计方案\\n\\n**项目名称：EchoAgent — 让AI资产流通成为可能**\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 一、项目愿景与概述\\n\\n### 核心理念\\n\\nECHO协议为数字资产提供了精细化的权限控制能力，而OpenClaw是目前最具生产力的AI Agent运行时之一。将二者结合，本质上是解决一个核心问题：\\n\\n> **如何让高价值的知识、经验、技能以\\\"资产\\\"的形式在AI时代流通、授权、计费？**\\n\\n传统AI Agent的能力是\\\"通用\\\"的，但真实世界中存在大量\\\"专精\\\"场景——一个法律Agent、一个医学顾问Agent、一个行业分析师Agent，其价值远高于通用Agent。EchoAgent要让这些专精能力像许可证一样被发行、授权、转让、使用。\\n\\n### 目标用户\\n\\n| 角色 | 诉求 |\\n|------|------|\\n| **资产发行方** (专家/IP所有者) | 将专业知识封装为可交易的ECHO资产，获得被动收入 |\\n| **企业/团队** | 批量采购专业Agent能力，控制使用权限和成本 |\\n| **个人用户** | 按需获取高质量AI能力，无需维护复杂基础设施 |\\n| **开发者** | 基于ECHO协议构建Agent服务，扩展生态 |\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 二、系统架构设计\\n\\n### 2.1 整体架构图（文字描述）\\n\\n```\\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\\n│                        用户层 (User Layer)                       │\\n│   [Web Dashboard]  [Telegram/Discord Bot]  [CLI]  [API]         │\\n└────────────────────────────┬────────────────────────────────────┘\\n                             │\\n                             ▼\\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\\n│                    OpenClaw Agent Core                          │\\n│  ┌──────────────┐  ┌────────────────┐  ┌──────────────────────┐│\\n│  │   Main Agent │  │  EchoAgent     │  │  License Manager     ││\\n│  │   (Router)   │◄─┤  (资产操作)     │◄─┤  (权限验证/计费)     ││\\n│  └──────────────┘  └────────────────┘  └──────────────────────┘│\\n│         │                  │                     │            │\\n│         └──────────────────┼─────────────────────┘            │\\n│                            │                                   │\\n│                    [ECHO Protocol SDK]                         │\\n└────────────────────────────┼────────────────────────────────────┘\\n                             │\\n                             ▼\\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\\n│                      区块链层 (Blockchain)                       │\\n│  ┌──────────────────┐    ┌──────────────────────────────────┐  │\\n│  │  ECHO Smart      │◄──►│  Wallet / Signer Service          │  │\\n│  │  Contract        │    │  (MPC / HSM / Browser Wallet)     │  │\\n│  │  (on EVM Chain)  │    └──────────────────────────────────┘  │\\n│  └──────────────────┘                                          │\\n└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\\n                             │\\n                             ▼\\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\\n│                      服务层 (Services)                           │\\n│  ┌──────────────┐  ┌──────────────┐  ┌────────────────────────┐ │\\n│  │  Payment     │  │  License     │  │  Agent Registry        │ │\\n│  │  Gateway     │  │  State DB    │  │  & Discovery           │ │\\n│  │  (Stripe/    │  │  (PostgreSQL)│  │  (Registry Contract)   │ │\\n│  │   Crypto)    │  │              │  │                        │ │\\n│  └──────────────┘  └──────────────┘  └────────────────────────┘ │\\n└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\\n```\\n\\n### 2.2 数据流向\\n\\n```\\n发行流程:\\n  发行方 → 部署Agent服务 → 注册到Registry → 创建ECHO资产 → 上架市场\\n\\n授权流程:\\n  用户 → 浏览资产目录 → 发起订阅/购买 → 链上授权 → 获取Agent访问权限\\n\\n使用流程:\\n  用户 → 向Agent发送请求 → Agent验证License → 执行任务 → 记录用量\\n\\n计费流程:\\n  用量记录 → 定期结算 → 从预存款扣除 / 按次扣费 → 发行方提现\\n```\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 三、核心功能模块详细设计\\n\\n### 3.1 EchoAsset Agent Service（资产Agent服务）\\n\\n**职责：** 将ECHO资产封装为Agent可理解、可操作的对象。\\n\\n```typescript\\n// 核心抽象\\ninterface EchoAsset {\\n  assetId: string;          // ECHO合约中的资产ID\\n  assetType: 'License' | 'Subscription' | 'AccessToken';\\n  issuer: string;           // 发行方地址\\n  holder: string;           // 当前持有方地址\\n  metadata: AssetMetadata;  // 公开元数据\\n  permissions: Permission[]; // 该资产的权限列表\\n  expiresAt?: number;       // 过期时间（Subscription/AccessToken）\\n  usageCount?: number;      // 已使用次数（License）\\n}\\n\\n// 资产操作\\nclass EchoAssetAgent {\\n  // 查询资产\\n  async getAsset(assetId: string): Promise<EchoAsset>\\n  \\n  // 查询用户持有的所有资产\\n  async getHolderAssets(holder: string): Promise<EchoAsset[]>\\n  \\n  // 转让资产\\n  async transferAsset(assetId: string, to: string): Promise<TxHash>\\n  \\n  // 使用License（消费型）\\n  async consumeLicens\\n…(truncated)…\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"api\": \"anthropic-messages\",\n      \"provider\": \"minimax\",\n      \"model\": \"minimax-m2.5:free\",\n      \"stopReason\": \"stop\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1774780979551,\n      \"responseId\": \"06183534c965e9057f4851ba0891bc7b\",\n      \"__openclaw\": {\n        \"id\": \"e220aaac\",\n        \"seq\": 2\n      }\n    }\n  ],\n  \"truncated\": true,\n  \"droppedMessages\": false,\n  \"contentTruncated\": true,\n  \"contentRedacted\": false,\n  \"bytes\": 8749\n}"}],"details":{"sessionKey":"agent:lucus:subagent:4ad0a177-b8dd-42e6-9c29-49cac741b022","messages":[{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Continue where you left off. The previous model attempt failed or timed out."}],"timestamp":1774780979479,"__openclaw":{"id":"17876d90","seq":1}},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants me to continue with the task I was assigned. Let me review the subagent context:\n\nI was tasked with designing a complete project that integrates the ECHO protocol (an asset licensing/permission protocol on EVM) with OpenClaw AI Agent ecosystem.\n\nLet me continue and produce the comprehensive project design document.\n\n## ECHO Protocol Summary:\n- Roles: Issuer (creates/manages assets), Holder (holds assets), User (temporary users)\n- Operations: issue, transfer, view_meta, view_secret, use_license, pause/resume/expire_license, grant_usage\n- Asset types: License (consumable), Subscription (time-limited), AccessToken (temporary)\n\n## Task Requirements:\n1. Overall architecture design\n2. Core functional modules\n3. React frontend project design\n4. Technology selection & implementation roadmap\n\nLet me produce a comprehensive design document."},{"type":"text","text":"<final>\n\n# ECHO Protocol × OpenClaw AI Agent 整合项目设计方案\n\n**项目名称：EchoAgent — 让AI资产流通成为可能**\n\n---\n\n## 一、项目愿景与概述\n\n### 核心理念\n\nECHO协议为数字资产提供了精细化的权限控制能力，而OpenClaw是目前最具生产力的AI Agent运行时之一。将二者结合，本质上是解决一个核心问题：\n\n> **如何让高价值的知识、经验、技能以\"资产\"的形式在AI时代流通、授权、计费？**\n\n传统AI Agent的能力是\"通用\"的，但真实世界中存在大量\"专精\"场景——一个法律Agent、一个医学顾问Agent、一个行业分析师Agent，其价值远高于通用Agent。EchoAgent要让这些专精能力像许可证一样被发行、授权、转让、使用。\n\n### 目标用户\n\n| 角色 | 诉求 |\n|------|------|\n| **资产发行方** (专家/IP所有者) | 将专业知识封装为可交易的ECHO资产，获得被动收入 |\n| **企业/团队** | 批量采购专业Agent能力，控制使用权限和成本 |\n| **个人用户** | 按需获取高质量AI能力，无需维护复杂基础设施 |\n| **开发者** | 基于ECHO协议构建Agent服务，扩展生态 |\n\n---\n\n## 二、系统架构设计\n\n### 2.1 整体架构图（文字描述）\n\n```\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│                        用户层 (User Layer)                       │\n│   [Web Dashboard]  [Telegram/Discord Bot]  [CLI]  [API]         │\n└────────────────────────────┬────────────────────────────────────┘\n                             │\n                             ▼\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│                    OpenClaw Agent Core                          │\n│  ┌──────────────┐  ┌────────────────┐  ┌──────────────────────┐│\n│  │   Main Agent │  │  EchoAgent     │  │  License Manager     ││\n│  │   (Router)   │◄─┤  (资产操作)     │◄─┤  (权限验证/计费)     ││\n│  └──────────────┘  └────────────────┘  └──────────────────────┘│\n│         │                  │                     │            │\n│         └──────────────────┼─────────────────────┘            │\n│                            │                                   │\n│                    [ECHO Protocol SDK]                         │\n└────────────────────────────┼────────────────────────────────────┘\n                             │\n                             ▼\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│                      区块链层 (Blockchain)                       │\n│  ┌──────────────────┐    ┌──────────────────────────────────┐  │\n│  │  ECHO Smart      │◄──►│  Wallet / Signer Service          │  │\n│  │  Contract        │    │  (MPC / HSM / Browser Wallet)     │  │\n│  │  (on EVM Chain)  │    └──────────────────────────────────┘  │\n│  └──────────────────┘                                          │\n└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n                             │\n                             ▼\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│                      服务层 (Services)                           │\n│  ┌──────────────┐  ┌──────────────┐  ┌────────────────────────┐ │\n│  │  Payment     │  │  License     │  │  Agent Registry        │ │\n│  │  Gateway     │  │  State DB    │  │  & Discovery           │ │\n│  │  (Stripe/    │  │  (PostgreSQL)│  │  (Registry Contract)   │ │\n│  │   Crypto)    │  │              │  │                        │ │\n│  └──────────────┘  └──────────────┘  └────────────────────────┘ │\n└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n```\n\n### 2.2 数据流向\n\n```\n发行流程:\n  发行方 → 部署Agent服务 → 注册到Registry → 创建ECHO资产 → 上架市场\n\n授权流程:\n  用户 → 浏览资产目录 → 发起订阅/购买 → 链上授权 → 获取Agent访问权限\n\n使用流程:\n  用户 → 向Agent发送请求 → Agent验证License → 执行任务 → 记录用量\n\n计费流程:\n  用量记录 → 定期结算 → 从预存款扣除 / 按次扣费 → 发行方提现\n```\n\n---\n\n## 三、核心功能模块详细设计\n\n### 3.1 EchoAsset Agent Service（资产Agent服务）\n\n**职责：** 将ECHO资产封装为Agent可理解、可操作的对象。\n\n```typescript\n// 核心抽象\ninterface EchoAsset {\n  assetId: string;          // ECHO合约中的资产ID\n  assetType: 'License' | 'Subscription' | 'AccessToken';\n  issuer: string;           // 发行方地址\n  holder: string;           // 当前持有方地址\n  metadata: AssetMetadata;  // 公开元数据\n  permissions: Permission[]; // 该资产的权限列表\n  expiresAt?: number;       // 过期时间（Subscription/AccessToken）\n  usageCount?: number;      // 已使用次数（License）\n}\n\n// 资产操作\nclass EchoAssetAgent {\n  // 查询资产\n  async getAsset(assetId: string): Promise<EchoAsset>\n  \n  // 查询用户持有的所有资产\n  async getHolderAssets(holder: string): Promise<EchoAsset[]>\n  \n  // 转让资产\n  async transferAsset(assetId: string, to: string): Promise<TxHash>\n  \n  // 使用License（消费型）\n  async consumeLicens\n…(truncated)…"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"minimax-m2.5:free","stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774780979551,"responseId":"06183534c965e9057f4851ba0891bc7b","__openclaw":{"id":"e220aaac","seq":2}}],"truncated":true,"droppedMessages":false,"contentTruncated":true,"contentRedacted":false,"bytes":8749},"isError":false,"timestamp":1774781180229}}
{"type":"message","id":"2846b35d","parentId":"c66b6e5b","timestamp":"2026-03-29T10:46:47.175Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The subagent output is still truncated. It seems the full content was quite long. Let me save what we have so far and also re-spawn a subagent to get the complete design, or I can ask the subagent to produce the remaining parts (React project design, implementation roadmap, etc.).\n\nActually, let me think about this differently. I have the beginning of a great design document from the subagent. The key sections covered are:\n1. Project Vision & Overview\n2. System Architecture\n3. Core Functional Modules (partial - got through EchoAssetAgent)\n\nThe truncated part is the rest of section 3 (License Manager, Payment Gateway, Agent Registry) and all of section 4 (React project design) and section 5 (Implementation roadmap).\n\nLet me spawn another subagent to complete the design, specifically focusing on the missing parts. Or better yet, let me write the React project design myself since I have the react-expert skill loaded.\n\nActually, looking at what I have, I think I should:\n1. Save the partial design to a file\n2. Ask the subagent to produce the remaining sections\n3. Or produce the React project design myself since I have the react-expert skill\n\nLet me save what we have and then complete the missing parts.","thinkingSignature":"0b64c12d876d6bfaa70665f01a437be46aae5a6ed9a63bcac9af2ec2535c5b1a"},{"type":"text","text":"内容被截断了，让我把已有的部分保存下来，然后继续完成剩余的React项目设计和实施路线图：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_mdx9ejinmreo_1","name":"sessions_spawn","arguments":{"task":"继续完成ECHO Protocol × OpenClaw整合项目的设计方案。\n\n## 已完成的部分（保存到 /home/node/.openclaw/workspace-lucus/ECHO-OpenClaw项目设计方案.md）：\n\n### 一、项目愿景\n- 项目名称：EchoAgent\n- 核心理念：将高价值知识/技能以\"资产\"形式在AI时代流通\n\n### 二、系统架构\n- 四层架构：用户层 → OpenClaw Agent Core → 区块链层 → 服务层\n- 完整数据流描述\n\n### 三、核心功能模块（部分）\n- EchoAsset Agent Service（资产Agent服务）\n- License Manager（许可证管理器）- 待补充\n- Payment Gateway（支付网关）- 待补充\n- Agent Registry（Agent注册表）- 待补充\n\n## 待完成的内容：\n\n1. **License Manager详细设计**\n   - 权限验证逻辑\n   - 状态管理\n   - 与ECHO合约交互\n\n2. **Payment Gateway设计**\n   - 支付流程\n   - 计费模式（按次/订阅/预付）\n   - 与链上资产关联\n\n3. **Agent Registry设计**\n   - 发行方注册Agent服务\n   - 资产与Agent能力映射\n   - 发现与浏览机制\n\n4. **React前端项目详细设计**（重点）\n   - 项目结构（App Router vs Pages Router）\n   - 核心页面：资产市场、我的资产、Agent工作台\n   - 核心组件：AssetCard, LicenseManager, AgentChat, PaymentModal\n   - 状态管理方案\n   - 与Agent的API交互\n\n5. **商业模式与付费流程**\n\n6. **实施计划与里程碑**\n\n请输出完整的补充内容，我会将其追加到设计方案文件中。","runtime":"subagent","mode":"run"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"minimax-m2.5:free","usage":{"input":11830,"output":688,"cacheRead":8097,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":20615,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774781180244,"responseId":"061835fcaa3510e9a06f61026be726c0"}}
